<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About | Justin Mishra</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #000000;
            --card-bg: #050505;
            --card-hover: #0a0a0a;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            --border-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            --text-primary: #F2F2F2;
            --text-secondary: #888888;
            --font-main: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
            --radius-lg: 24px;
            --radius-full: 100px;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
        img, video { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

        /* Vibe Enablers */
        .noise-overlay {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999; opacity: 0.04;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        }
        
        .ambient-glow {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 80vw; height: 50vw;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            filter: blur(80px); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed; top: 24px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.7); backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            padding: 12px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; z-index: 1000;
        }
        .nav-logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
        .nav-links a { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-secondary); transition: color 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .nav-btn { background: var(--text-primary); color: var(--bg-color); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; transition: transform 0.2s; }
        .nav-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }

        /* About Hero */
        .about-hero {
            padding: 12rem 5% 4rem;
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
            font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .about-hero p {
            font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-secondary);
            max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* About Bento Grid */
        .bento-wrapper {
            max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 8rem;
        }

        .bento-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            grid-auto-rows: 350px; gap: 16px;
        }

        .bento-card {
            background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg); position: relative; overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 32px;
        }

        .bento-card:hover { background: var(--card-hover); border-color: var(--border-hover); }

        /* Spans */
        .col-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
        .col-3 { grid-column: span 3; }
        .col-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
        .row-2 { grid-row: span 2; }

        /* Portrait Card */
        .portrait-card { padding: 0; justify-content: flex-end; }
        .portrait-card img { filter: grayscale(20%); transition: transform 0.8s ease, filter 0.8s ease; }
        .portrait-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.03); filter: grayscale(0%); }
        
        .overlay-gradient {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 32px 32px; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.9) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .overlay-gradient h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; }
        .overlay-gradient span { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; }

        /* Text Cards */
        .text-content { margin-top: auto; }
        .text-content h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .text-content p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* List Grid */
        .capabilities-list {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: auto;
        }
        .capabilities-list div {
            padding: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        /* Massive Footer */
        footer {
            padding: 8rem 24px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
        .footer-title {
            font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 12rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.05em;
            line-height: 0.85; color: var(--text-primary); transition: color 0.3s; display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer-title:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }

        /* Scroll Animations */
        .fade-up { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
        .fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .col-3, .col-4 { grid-column: span 2; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .col-2, .col-3, .col-4 { grid-column: span 1; }
            .row-2 { grid-row: span 1; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .capabilities-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="noise-overlay"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow"></div>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">JM.</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html#work">Work</a>
            <a href="about.html" class="active">About</a>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:hello@justinmishra.com" class="nav-btn">Let's Talk</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="about-hero fade-up">
        <h1>Behind the<br>Lens.</h1>
        <p>A multidisciplinary storyteller capturing truth through movement, light, and unscripted moments.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="bento-wrapper">
        <div class="bento-grid">
            
            <!-- Portrait Image (Spans 2 columns, 2 rows) -->
            <div class="bento-card portrait-card col-2 row-2 fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Justin Mishra">
                <div class="overlay-gradient">
                    <h3>Justin Mishra</h3>
                    <span>Director / Choreographer</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bio Card (Spans 2 columns) -->
            <div class="bento-card col-2 fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
                <div class="text-content">
                    <h2>The Vision</h2>
                    <p>Based in Delhi-NCR, my journey spans across independent short films, high-end wedding cinematography, and stage choreography. I believe that strong visuals begin with strong intent. Before the camera rolls, I take time to understand the rhythm of the subject, the natural light of the space, and the story that truly needs to be told.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Capabilities Grid -->
            <div class="bento-card col-2 fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
                <div class="text-content" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
                    <h2>Capabilities</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="capabilities-list">
                    <div>Cinematography</div>
                    <div>Creative Direction</div>
                    <div>Choreography</div>
                    <div>Color Grading</div>
                    <div>Event Coverage</div>
                    <div>Portraiture</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Philosophy Quote (Spans full width) -->
            <div class="bento-card col-4 fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;">
                <h2 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 300; max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--text-primary);">
                    "The best moments aren't directed, they are anticipated and captured."
                </h2>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Massive Footer -->
    <footer class="fade-up">
        <a href="mailto:hello@justinmishra.com" class="footer-title">START A<br>PROJECT</a>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
                entries.forEach(entry => {
                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                        entry.target.classList.add('visible');
                    }
                });
            }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: "0px 0px -50px 0px" });

            document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach((el) => { observer.observe(el); });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
